# The search in a Medium window's sidebar (MBUI_FIXTURE=home MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2 MBUI_WIN=800x880 MBUI_LOCALE=en-US):
# its list pulled down to the field, the field tapped, coming up as Cancel comes in beside it, where all of
# "Search everything" does not fit: said its shorter way (search.mbt search_field_shorter), the same all the way up.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
